Short:    TransAmiga BBS AminetCD upload tool v1.3
Uploader: rasa0011@fh-karlsruhe.de (Sami Radwan)
Author:   rasa0011@fh-karlsruhe.de (Sami Radwan)
Type:     comm/bbs

Requirements: AmigaDOS Join command and a multiassign command like Assign of
              AmigaOS 3.1 (I don't know if earlier assign commands work)

This tool is tested with AminetCD #5, #6 and #7. For earlier CDs I have the
corresponding versions around. If you need them contact me.

If there are no changes made to the structure of the TREE and INDEX file
and they stay located in the directory that contains all the Aminet
subdirectories this piece of tool will work with future AminetCD releases.

This tool makes the necessary directories and Files.BBS to integrate
AminetCDs in the fileareas of TransAmiga BBS without the need of an external
door program. Have a look at the docs for a complete description.

New for this version: Added NODESC command line switch.

Greetings,
      Sami. (TransAmiga BBS Development)

